{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-inter-shell-operator","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:inter-shell-operator","kind":"definition","title":"Inter-shell torus-knot operator $\\Phi_{\\mathrm{shell}}^{(\\ell)}$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-chebyshev-torus-coefficients"],"tags":["torus-knot","shell-binding","transfer-matrix","hecke-algebra","groebner-basis","nuclear-structure"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.InterShellOperator","text":"inter-shell-operator.md","leanSource":"inter-shell-operator.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:inter-shell-operator\"></a><p>Let shell <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell</code> contain <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_s</code> nucleons and be closed. The <strong>inter-shell operator</strong> of shell <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell</code> is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\Phi_{\\mathrm{shell}}^{(\\ell)} \\colon H_A(q) \\to H_{A+1}(q),\n  \\qquad\n  \\bar{\\mathcal{N}}_A \\mapsto r\\!\\bigl(\\bar{\\mathcal{N}}_A \\cdot (c_{n_s}\\sigma + d_{n_s}), G\\bigr),</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(c_{n_s}, d_{n_s})</code> are the <a href=\"#def:chebyshev-torus-coefficients\" data-at=\"predicted-spectra/atomic-shells-foundations\">Chebyshev crossing coefficients</a> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2, n_s}</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">r(\\cdot, G)</code> denotes the Gröbner--Shirshov division algorithm.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/inter-shell-operator.md","heading":"Definition","number":"16.14.17","page":"b/def-inter-shell-operator","qa":{"counts":{"pass":77,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":63},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.Archimedean.InterShellOperator","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/inter-shell-operator.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
